{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "LTX VFX: Slow motion (LoRA Slow-Motion-Control 1.0)",
    "description": "Core ComfyUI nodes only (LTX-2.5 support in ComfyUI core). Distilled LTX-2.5 22B (int8), 8 fixed sigmas, euler_ancestral, cfg 1 (LTXVDualCFGGuider 1/1). Image to video, the official LTX-2.5 two-stage recipe: half-size stage 1 (8 sigmas, first frame strength 0.7) -> LTXVLatentUpsampler x2 -> stage 2 (3 sigmas, first frame strength 1.0). Slow-Motion-Control reads the speed from the conditioning frame rate: LTXVConditioning and the audio latent get motion_fps = 24 / speed while playback (CreateVideo) stays 24 fps. Speeds 0.5 / 0.2 (default) / 0.1 / 0.05 / 0.025. No trigger word and no 'slow motion' wording in the prompt. 1280x704, 121 frames (5 s). No audio. LTX-2 Community License (ltx-2.x-community-license, gated on Hugging Face)."
  },
